  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut potato into wedges.\n• Place on lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Bake until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6441c692d1e107d1300f3995/step-8b620ad0.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop tomato and coriander.\n• Grate carrot, then squeeze out any excess moisture using a paper towel (this helps fritters crisp up in the pan).\n• Drain sweetcorn.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6441c692d1e107d1300f3995/step-d8a3c4eb.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, combine carrot, corn, coriander, taco seasoning, the plain flour, egg, milk, Cheddar cheese and a pinch of salt and pepper.\n• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat the base over medium-high heat.\n• When oil is hot, add heaped tablespoons of fritter mixture in batches and flatten with a spatula. Cook until golden, 3-4 mins each side (don't flip too early!).\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate. You should get 3-4 fritters per person.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6441c692d1e107d1300f3995/step-0d7778cc.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, combine salad leaves, tomato and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season.\n• Divide fritters, wedges and salad between plates.\n• Serve with garlic aioli.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6441c692d1e107d1300f3995/step-877fd02b.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
